  "limits": [
    "Bounded TT023 repair only: interrupted observer returns before held actual initializer fails materially; retained cleanup reports that previously unobserved safe error once after cancellation and physical drain. No whole-ticket closure or original54-question resolution claim.",
    "Six genuine RED rows and four success/owned-cancellation controls precede production change. Raw IOException, already-safe LateSeedWrite/53100, and late actual TimeoutException inputs cross caller cancellation and observation deadline.",
